  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Once primeval essence is poured in, it grows at once into a tree about eighteen meters tall. The roots and branches twist like dragons and snakes. The trunk is about ten meters across at the base, brown, and not a single solid mass: it holds three layers of space, with windows that let in sunlight and air. Branches and leaves are scarce on the trunk; only the treetop is verdant and lush. At the base are two wide doors. Inside, the three layers become store layout, with wooden counters that are part of the tree. The three star cave tree Gu can grow green leaves and branches, and it can also grow different designs according to the Gu Master’s will, including stools and benches.",
        "chapters": [
          109
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The three rooms in those three layers have defensive power far above ordinary tents, which is why the caravan keeps more precious Gu inside the treehouse rather than in canvas stalls.",
        "chapters": [
          109
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later lists three star cave among the most common Gu houses he has met after rebirth. Collected, it turns into a seed. Planted, it grows into an enormous hollow tree with three floors. Ordinary Gu houses are combinations of several Gu worms. Three star cave, lizard house, and large lizard house are simplified branches formed from just one Gu, so their might is greatly reduced, and they become commonly used Gu houses.",
        "chapters": [
          568
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "single-gu-house",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
