  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Jia Fu’s caravan brings one to Qing Mao Mountain. Among a stretch of tents it stands as an enormous tree, the most common type of Gu house that caravan uses. A rank three support Gu Master stays inside it, operating and watching the counters. If someone tries to snatch the displayed Gu, that operator can close the doors into a momentary prison, grow branches for a group attack, and leave the rest to the security Gu Masters in the tree.",
        "chapters": [
          109
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_jia_fu",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "sys_gu_house",
          "sys_gu_master",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later recounting of that same Qing Mao Mountain caravan calls three star cave a wood path Gu worm used to make a Gu house: eighteen meters tall, thick roots like coiling snakes, a three-layer trunk with windows, and defense on another level from tents. When used, a support Gu Master plants the seeds and injects primeval essence for the tree to grow. When they want to keep it, the tree turns back into a seed. In Northern Plains, ordinary Gu houses are not large trees like this, because such a tall tree is an easy target for lightning in heavy rain.",
        "chapters": [
          439
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "seed-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "reg_northern_plains"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit sends Fang Yuan housing Gu that include the wood path Gu worm three star cave. After it is used, it turns into a tree house with space in the trunk.",
        "chapters": [
          1032
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "housing-after-revival",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He spends a night inside that house Gu inspecting his immortal aperture, then leaves the three star cave Gu around dawn.",
        "chapters": [
          1033
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "housing-after-revival",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
